## 📡 API Endpoints

### 📄 Documents

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `POST` | `/api/documents/upload` | Upload a document |
| `GET` | `/api/documents` | List all documents |
| `GET` | `/api/documents/{id}` | Get document details |
| `DELETE` | `/api/documents/{id}` | Delete a document |

### 🧠 Knowledge

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/knowledge` | List all knowledge items |
| `GET` | `/api/knowledge/{id}` | Get knowledge item |
| `POST` | `/api/knowledge/search` | Semantic search |

### 🤖 Agents

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `POST` | `/api/agents/knowledge-miner/run` | Trigger Knowledge Miner |
| `POST` | `/api/agents/validator/run` | Trigger Validator |
| `POST` | `/api/agents/summarizer/run` | Trigger Summarizer |
| `POST` | `/api/agents/graph-builder/run` | Trigger Graph Builder |
| `POST` | `/api/agents/memory-manager/run` | Trigger Memory Manager |
| `POST` | `/api/agents/orchestrate` | Run full pipeline |
| `GET` | `/api/agents/logs` | Get agent activity logs |

### 🕸️ Graph

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/graph/nodes` | Get all graph nodes |
| `GET` | `/api/graph/edges` | Get all graph edges |
| `GET` | `/api/graph/visualize` | Full graph for UI |
| `POST` | `/api/graph/rebuild` | Rebuild entire graph |

### 📊 Dashboard

| Method | Endpoint | Description |
|--------|----------|-------------|
| `GET` | `/api/dashboard/stats` | Overall statistics |
| `GET` | `/api/dashboard/activity` | Recent agent activity |

---

## 🗄️ Database Schema

| Table | Purpose |
|-------|---------|
| `documents` | Uploaded files metadata |
| `knowledge_items` | Extracted structured facts |
| `validations` | Fact-check results |
| `summaries` | Generated document summaries |
| `graph_nodes` | Concepts in knowledge graph |
| `graph_edges` | Relationships between concepts |
| `agent_logs` | Agent activity tracking |

Full schema → see [`database/schema.sql`](database/schema.sql)

