## 📌 Overview

**Knowledge Evolution Platform** is an AI-powered system where **5 autonomous agents** collaborate to continuously **extract, validate, summarize, and evolve** enterprise knowledge — automatically detecting obsolete information, validating facts, and maintaining semantic consistency across documents.

Built as a **practice project** demonstrating **multi-agent orchestration**, **LLM-powered reasoning**, and **knowledge graph generation** using **Google Gemini API** — no GPU required, runs on any CPU-based machine.

> 💡 **Why this project?** Enterprises drown in outdated documents. Manual curation is impossible at scale. AI agents can do it 24/7 — automatically.

---

## 🎯 Problem Statement

Modern enterprises generate massive amounts of knowledge daily — policies, reports, FAQs, documentation. Over time, this knowledge becomes a liability:

| Problem | Impact |
|---------|--------|
| 📉 **Obsolete information** | Old policies still in circulation cause confusion |
| ❌ **Unverified facts** | Incorrect claims persist and mislead employees |
| 🔁 **Duplicate knowledge** | Same info stored in 5 different places |
| 🕸️ **Lost relationships** | No semantic linking between related concepts |
| 📚 **Bloated documents** | No summaries, no structure, no hierarchy |

**Manual curation doesn't scale.** AI agents do.

---

## 💡 Solution

A **multi-agent system** where each agent has a specialized role, collaborating through an **orchestrator** to evolve the knowledge base continuously:

| Agent | Icon | Role |
|-------|------|------|
| **Knowledge Miner** | ⛏️ | Extracts structured facts from unstructured documents using Gemini |
| **Validator** | ✅ | Verifies facts — checks accuracy, freshness, and contradictions |
| **Summarizer** | 📝 | Generates concise summaries of long documents |
| **Graph Builder** | 🕸️ | Constructs semantic knowledge graphs (concepts + relationships) |
| **Memory Manager** | 🧠 | Stores, versions, and marks knowledge as obsolete |

---

## ✨ Key Features

### 🤖 Multi-Agent Intelligence
- **5 specialized AI agents** working in collaboration
- **Orchestrator** coordinating agent workflows
- **Agent activity logs** for full transparency
- **Real-time status monitoring** on dashboard

### 🔗 AI & Knowledge Processing
- **Google Gemini API** integration (`gemini-1.5-flash`) for LLM reasoning
- **Document upload** support (TXT, PDF, DOCX)
- **Automatic fact extraction** with confidence scores
- **Fact validation** — detects outdated, incorrect, or contradictory information
- **Auto-summarization** of long documents
- **Obsolete detection** — flags information past its relevance window

### 🕸️ Knowledge Graph
- **Interactive graph visualization** using React Flow
- **Concept extraction** from documents
- **Relationship mapping** — links related concepts
- **Weighted edges** showing relationship strength
- **Zoom, pan, filter** controls

### 📊 Dashboard & Monitoring
- **Real-time agent activity feed**
- **Knowledge growth analytics** (charts)
- **Stats cards** — documents, knowledge items, validations
- **Recent documents** feed
- **Agent health status**

### 🎨 Modern UI/UX
- **Dark theme** with glassmorphism
- **Gradient accents** (purple → cyan)
- **Smooth animations** with Framer Motion
- **Responsive design** (mobile + desktop)
- **Toast notifications** for user feedback
- **Loading skeletons** for better UX

### 🗄️ Data Management
- **SQLite** for lightweight local storage (practice-friendly)
- **SQLAlchemy ORM** for data modeling
- **Alembic migrations** for schema versioning
- **ChromaDB** (optional) for semantic vector search
- **Versioned knowledge** — track evolution over time

---

## 🏗️ Architecture

```
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                       REACT FRONTEND                            │
│  ┌───────────┐ ┌────────┐ ┌───────────┐ ┌───────┐ ┌─────────┐  │
│  │ Dashboard │ │ Upload │ │ Knowledge │ │ Graph │ │ Agents  │  │
│  └───────────┘ └────────┘ └───────────┘ └───────┘ └─────────┘  │
└─────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────┘
                              │ REST API (JSON)
                              ▼
┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     FASTAPI BACKEND                             │
│                                                                 │
│  ┌───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │
│  │                  AGENT ORCHESTRATOR                       │ │
│  │  ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐                  │ │
│  │  │  Miner   │ │Validator │ │Summarizer│                  │ │
│  │  └──────────┘ └──────────┘ └──────────┘                  │ │
│  │  ┌──────────┐ ┌──────────┐                               │ │
│  │  │  Graph   │ │  Memory  │                               │ │
│  │  │ Builder  │ │ Manager  │                               │ │
│  │  └──────────┘ └──────────┘                               │ │
│  └───────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────┘ │
│                              │                                 │
│                    ┌─────────▼─────────┐                       │
│                    │   GEMINI SERVICE  │                       │
│                    │   (LLM Reasoning) │                       │
│                    └─────────┬─────────┘                       │
└──────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────────┘
                               │
              ┌────────────────▼─────────────────┐
              │  Google Gemini API (Cloud)       │
              └──────────────────────────────────┘

┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                     DATA LAYER                                  │
│  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐  ┌──────────────┐          │
│  │   SQLite     │  │  ChromaDB    │  │  File Store  │          │
│  │  (Relational)│  │  (Vectors)   │  │  (Uploads)   │          │
│  └──────────────┘  └──────────────┘  └──────────────┘          │
└─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

---

## 🔄 How It Works (User Flow)

```
1. USER UPLOADS a document (HR policy, IT security, FAQ)
              │
              ▼
2. KNOWLEDGE MINER extracts structured facts using Gemini
              │
              ▼
3. VALIDATOR checks each fact — valid / outdated / incorrect
              │
              ▼
4. SUMMARIZER generates a concise summary
              │
              ▼
5. GRAPH BUILDER links concepts into a semantic knowledge graph
              │
              ▼
6. MEMORY MANAGER stores everything & marks old facts obsolete
              │
              ▼
7. DASHBOARD shows live agent activity & knowledge stats
```

